// 2. Else (`m >= n-1`), minimum components = 1, let `extra = m - (n-1)`. If `extra <= (n-1)/2` (i.e., `m <= n-1 + (n-1)/2`), then max bridges = `(n-1) - 2*extra`. Else max bridges = 0.
